LGPL Compliance Note
--------------------

OpenCASCADE Technology is linked dynamically (shared libraries, DLL/SO).
Qt 6 is linked dynamically (shared libraries, DLL/SO).
Dynamic linking satisfies the LGPL redistribution requirements for both
libraries when end-users retain the right to relink against modified versions
of OCCT and Qt. As this is an internal tool, redistribution to end-users is
not applicable; LGPL obligations are therefore satisfied by design.
